###  https://graphbench.org/order-management#PickItem
om:PickItem rdf:type owl:Class ;
            rdfs:subClassOf ocel:Event .


###  https://graphbench.org/order-management#PlaceOrder
om:PlaceOrder rdf:type owl:Class ;
              rdfs:subClassOf ocel:Event .


###  https://graphbench.org/order-management#Product
om:Product rdf:type owl:Class ;
